the dedicated settings panel. Tap the generate button, and the staircase will appear in mixed reality right before your eyes. Grab it and hold it against the wall to see how it fits into your space. Not happy with the result? No problem\u2014you can tweak any setting and regenerate a new version at any time.", "short_description": "This app is a simple and convenient mixed-reality staircase generator that can help with home planning and construction."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "stair_generator_vr_3000x900_title_only.png", "id": "2592513977885429", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619808_2592513981218762_4968721126324708930_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NBuR9YoLhqEQ7kNvwEX8EJO&_nc_oc=AdrEZ1YitCKU98AWZWoqfZRBIGBM7J54rqX-7axSom8v7wpDHW_A4xcX63if_Nyuv6w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI-bHZXk9MsP4R15oyVETrQTWsJhnLe7EP8Y2RDCHXKAg&oe=6AA96921"}, {"file_name": "stair_vr_app_icon_512x512.png", "id": "2149252839266448", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619808_2149252842599781_4754249076677587729_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sht8p_sJ5skQ7kNvwH6bpsJ&_nc_oc=Adrq9g0xDIaTPXGGa5F1a5lqAg2E3M77eUSDQ3GtGhTkuMqujNTd4v3cizuGouqIN-8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJgcs8cQYV5ZN5c-EqIgfw9JEojldWcT_k5PwZFdUAXsA&oe=6AA95F59"}, {"file_name": "stair_generator_vr_1440x1440_title_only.png", "id": "1694386571863177", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623314_1694386575196510_7075524280348811805_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5mT6OeB36xEQ7kNvwFr5DVV&_nc_oc=Adry97usgujfUDXK6qe9Ibic4Jv6c91fo6kJaxLwJndAONl__a7a5t6AISSZdBSu7KI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIimRPq9Ek-G39Xr722FJav-F6CPQK8aB0MYDXfHn2fcQ&oe=6AA932E6"}, {"file_name": "stair_generator